title: 'C-c g v   : skg-goto-viewnode-id'
pid: 55ffa6be-3e6a-4505-a01c-e18c65a44fc3
body: |2-
  Moves point to the headline carrying a viewnode ID, read from the
  minibuffer. A message names each headline it concerns by its
  viewnode ID, with this command: "To find it: C-c g v X". It finds
  the headline while heralds stand in for its metadata, and opens the folds
  around it. See =docs/api-and-formats.org=, "How a message names a
  headline".
